      "PROVENANCE.md": "# Grill Me provenance\n\n- Upstream: `https://github.com/mattpocock/skills`\n- Source commit: `e9fcdf95b402d360f90f1db8d776d5dd450f9234`\n- User entry point: `skills/productivity/grill-me/SKILL.md`\n- Canonical interview protocol: `skills/productivity/grilling/SKILL.md`\n- License: MIT; see `LICENSE`.\n\nThe upstream `grill-me` file delegates to a harness slash command. OpenCorvus publishes one `grill-me` identity containing the canonical `grilling` protocol so there is no unresolved recursive command and no duplicated protocol source.\n",
